            <ArticleTitle>Prenylated benzoic acid derivatives from the stem of Euodia lepta.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1589-1593</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1080/14786419.2017.1283493</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two new prenylated benzoic acid derivatives, leptoic acid A and (+)-S-anodendroic acid (1-2), along with one known compound, 2,2-dimethyl-2H-1-benzopyran-6-carboxylic acid (3) were isolated from the stem of Euodia lepta (spreng.) Merr. Their structures were elucidated on the basis of the chemical and spectroscopic evidence.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
